CommitProof builds and tests Multigres (https://github.com/multigres/multigres,
Copyright 2025 Supabase, Inc., Apache License 2.0). The files build/Dockerfile
and build/Dockerfile.pgctld are copies of Multigres' Dockerfile and
Dockerfile.pgctld at commit e3cbdbbb0b94453ca2ec43c9c40c05c98ed7bb73 with only
their FROM lines changed to digest-pinned references. deploy/pg_hba_template.conf
is copied from Multigres' demo/k8s/k8s-multipooler-statefulset.yaml at the same
commit. Observation code imports Multigres Go packages at that commit.
